      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer after the horrors of 7 October 2023 perpetrated by Hamas and its allies was first offered by Rabbi Lior Bar-Ami sometime before May 2024. The prayer is written in English with German translation, and includes a title in Hebrew, “תְּפִלָּה לְרִפּוּי וְאַחְדוּת מֵאָז 7 בְּאוֹקְטוֹבֶּר“.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_58505_notes"/>
